       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Unknown",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Just a note, this change provides additional flexibility with the format of the \"baseUrl\" value. Up until now, the format had to be fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest (where the hostname, port and path are arbitrary).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Now, it is possible to write:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest (as before)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "fcrepo://",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://fedora.host.org/rest"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://fedora.host.org/rest",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " (for connections with explicit schemes)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "fcrepo://fedora.host.org:443/rest (for secure connections)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "fcrepo://",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://fedora.host.org:9443/rest"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://fedora.host.org:9443/rest",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " (for secure connections on non-standard ports)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This brings the component more in line with how the camel-http4 component works in this regard.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "NB, as with all camel components, the initial forward slashes can be omitted without changing the meaning of the route. These two uris are equivalent:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "fcrepo:fedora.host.org:8080/rest",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "And that same variation applies to all of the examples above.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
