      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34cd24b6a5178b45e45b73c3c9f71e6f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FU-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Unknown",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Just a note, this change provides additional flexibility with the format of the \"baseUrl\" value. Up until now, the format had to be fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest (where the hostname, port and path are arbitrary).</p>\n\n<p>Now, it is possible to write:</p>\n\n<p>fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest (as before)<br/>\nfcrepo://<a href=\"http://fedora.host.org/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.host.org/rest</a> (for connections with explicit schemes)<br/>\nfcrepo://fedora.host.org:443/rest (for secure connections)<br/>\nfcrepo://<a href=\"https://fedora.host.org:9443/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.host.org:9443/rest</a> (for secure connections on non-standard ports)</p>\n\n<p>This brings the component more in line with how the camel-http4 component works in this regard.</p>\n\n<p>NB, as with all camel components, the initial forward slashes can be omitted without changing the meaning of the route. These two uris are equivalent:</p>\n\n<p>fcrepo://fedora.host.org:8080/rest<br/>\nfcrepo:fedora.host.org:8080/rest</p>\n\n<p>And that same variation applies to all of the examples above.</p>\n",
     "created": "29/Jan/15 10:41 AM",
     "id": "13251",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11304/comment/13251",
